<page "tree theming" notebook>
	<header level="1">
		Tree
		<header>A tree shows rows nested in rows, which open and close, and can be selected one or many at a time.</>
	</>
	<section>
		<toolbar class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Set a public `--ui-*` token on the element, any ancestor or `:root`; it inherits into the shadow
			root. Edit a value below to try it.
		</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-tree" playground>
				<ui-tree choose="many" label="Files" style="width: 16em">
					<ui-tree-item label="src" icon="folder" open>
						<ui-tree-item label="Card.spell" icon="file code" selected></>
						<ui-tree-item label="Deck.spell" icon="file code"></>
						<ui-tree-item label="styles" icon="folder">
							<ui-tree-item label="card.css" icon="file code"></>
						</>
					</>
					<ui-tree-item label="README.md" which="notes" icon="file alternate outline"></>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</page>
